research.falsifier:
The implementation is wrong if any of the following happens:
- the deficit is nonzero at Mass = 0;
- the deficit goes down when Mass goes up;
- the deficit goes up when Lower radius goes up with the gap fixed;
- the percentage readout shows the 12x-magnified value instead of the physical one;
- the readouts differ from the values above (about 1.71% at Mass 1, r 1; about 0.45% at Mass 1, r 2.5) by more than rounding.

Physically, the account would be contradicted by a precise clock comparison showing that clocks held at rest at different potentials agree, or that different clock types shift by different amounts. The notes list redshift experiments that reportedly confirm the effect, but they were not retrieved or verified here. These checks only validate the implementation and are not new science.
